  {
   "title": "The Sacking of Coruscant",
   "date": "3,653 BBY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "While the Republic's delegates negotiate on Alderaan, Darth Malgus's strike team burns the Jedi Temple and the Empire holds Coruscant hostage. The Treaty of Coruscant cedes the Outer Rim: Balmorra, Taris's ruins, a dozen sectors. Peace, on paper, for a decade.",
